{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_st03",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_st03",
  "title": "艺术馆餐厅",
  "storyCode": "CR-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "99c1272394332a40657946b06a75f8869a63cf2be622c790ce006cead258b118",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "我记得现在是午休时间，如果需要提审，你可能要晚点来——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "我不是来提审你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "哦，怎么，罗德岛也想踩着我的尸体分一杯羹吗？欢迎欢迎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "我只是来替坎黛拉女士告知你多索雷斯对你的最终处理结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "依据多索雷斯市长办公室的判断，多索雷斯将不会审判你的罪行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "让我猜猜，把我交给联合政府？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "虽然马特奥是个蠢货，但他毕竟是联合政府在多索雷斯的代表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "嗯......我三番五次地耍他玩，联合政府肯定等不及要把我挫骨扬灰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "你对局势的判断很精准。联合政府确实想把你抓去拉乌尼达公审，就像他们对马特奥做的一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "一场公审？很好，我很期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "不，雷内尔先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "你将被送回卡西米尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "......你再说一遍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "商业联合会向坎黛拉施加了压力，希望将你送回卡西米尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "你再说一遍？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "你父亲在联合会中留下的人脉发挥了作用，你现在不必留在多索雷斯，也不用去拉乌尼达，你可以回家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "不......我不会回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "我不会回到那些最卑劣、最下贱、最可悲的东西中去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "事到如今也由不得你了，雷内尔先生，不管你的最终归属是哪里，都是你鲁莽行动造成的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "是苦是甜，你都得自己咽下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "呵，老东西......你还真是阴魂不散啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "对了，还有一件事，你需要决定你财产的归属问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "说得好像，我真的能自己决定一样，坎黛拉不是早就想方设法把它们挪去其他地方了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "还有一些固定资产......没有人敢接手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "你就在这份转让合同上随便写个名字吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "......那就是下一个路过这里的人好了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "迪亚兹先生，你来监区干什么？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "指认假装人质的马特奥手下啊。反倒是你，你喊我干嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "没、没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "那我走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "哎......你......反正还没落笔，你随时可以反悔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "反悔？我从来都不反悔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "......何况，这么一想也不赖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "把它留给真正热爱艺术的家伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "雷内尔最后真的把那位老消防员的名字写上去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "是的。送他出多索雷斯的时候，我最后向他确认了一次，他还是在监区的那套说辞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "......他真是连他父亲一丁点的特质都没有继承。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "说实话，他大概不讨厌这种评价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "当然，但这句话可不是在夸他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，您和埃内斯托先生的咖啡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "好浓的香气！布克先生，我能请教一下用的是哪种咖啡豆吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "text": "是坎黛拉女士最近常喝的三种深烘豆拼配。请二位慢用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "现在事情告一段落，要见见你在多索雷斯其他的熟人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "其实我在进城之前没想过要惊动任何人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "的确，假如一切都风平浪静的话，你本可以不惊动任何人，但多索雷斯永远不可能风平浪静，你从来都知道这一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "......是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "就像现在，雷内尔的这场闹剧过后，联合政府在多索雷斯的声势遭到了沉重打击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "尽管从拉乌尼达寄来的抗议信一封接一封，但雷内尔和他的财产，他们想都别想。多索雷斯不是他们俯首帖耳的附庸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "可与之相应，其余两方也已经迫不及待——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "......瞧我，光顾着说这些没意思的东西了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "怎么会，这些都是很有意义的信息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "来，埃内斯托，尝尝看这种拼配合不合你的口味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "很浓郁......但也很奇妙的口感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "说来听听？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "我能分辨出三种豆的品种和香气，但我说不清究竟哪种豆才是其中占比最大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "三种香气原本各自为战，此消彼长，可很快又会在口中融汇成浓烈的焦香，再也不分彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "精准。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "这种拼配最大的卖点在于它没有严苛的比例限制，只要三种豆的占比不出现太大差距，就总能保持这种稳定的焦香。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "原来是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "怎么样，合你的口味吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "还没法下结论？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "没关系，那家店就在那里，只要你回来，随时都喝得到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "不仅如此，只要你想，让那家咖啡店按你的想法调配豆子，甚至往咖啡里加气泡水，也绝非不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "哈哈，您说笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "说笑吗？我倒不这么认为。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "因为我的确很期待你的选择，埃内斯托。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "哟，埃内斯托，你和这位坎黛拉市长聊了好长时间啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "没办法，我和她也算是老相识，还有挺多东西要聊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "聊了这么久，她是不是还挺喜欢你的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "还好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你这人......和自己相关的东西，是真的一句话也不愿多说啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "算了，既然你不愿意说，那我就不打听了，哼哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "就算你去问拉菲艾拉，她也不会告诉你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你是会什么读心的源石技艺吗？你怎么知道我要去问拉菲艾拉的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "都写在你脸上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "啧啧啧，这人好可怕啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "text": "顺便，我倒是从早上出发前就知道肯定会迟到，也很感谢你一直在这里等我，但我们现在已经错过和迪亚兹约好的时间了哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "——糟了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商业联合会员工",
      "text": "那么，雷内尔·科瓦尔斯基先生，您先请上车，我去拿行李。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷内尔面无表情地坐进后座，等车门合上后，他觉得温度有些高，于是将外套脱下放在一旁，随后倚在靠背上，正准备松开自己的衣领。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但车外一声异响打断了他的动作，他转头看向窗外，看见商业联合会的员工晕倒在车旁，不省人事。\n随后，轻敲玻璃的声响从车的另一侧响起，他顺着声音回头，看见有个熟悉的人站在车外。\n雷内尔摇下车窗，与一双黑亮的眼睛对上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "可以麻烦您载我一程吗，先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "那你要去哪里呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "这不一向是由你来决定的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "以前你总跟着我四处奔波，或许这次该由你来决定我们的目的地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "你真的没有想去的地方吗，米沃什？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "去哪里都一样，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "还是有些不一样的，这次我真的身无分文了，除了后备箱那两个行李箱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "既然如此，我来开车好了，等到燃料耗尽，车停在哪里，我们就去哪里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "嗯......好，你说了算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "冲雷内尔露出一个笑容，米沃什打开前门，坐上了驾驶位，在启动前，他从后视镜看到了雷内尔的脸。\n此刻，雷内尔的表情混合着迷惑、欣喜和些许的犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "你看起来有些话想问我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "为什么回来？为什么不离开？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "你难道不知道答案吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "也许我不是询问，我只是想证实那个答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "......别这么笃定，或许我很快就会因为忍受不了你而选择离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "text": "但不是今天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "text": "对，不是今天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从后视镜收回视线，米沃什重重发动引擎，银色轿车绝尘而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如今，克里斯达尔艺术馆的展厅仍然保持着那一天的样貌。\n破碎的展柜，被烧焦的地面，出现裂痕的墙体；五彩斑斓的射灯，肆意妄为的涂鸦，狂放不羁的音乐......\n除了房间正中央的大圆桌。\n火候正好的烤肉正在桌子上滋滋作响，散发出诱人的香气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "动手呀，怎么都没反应？难道不饿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "......只是没想到这里会变成烤肉店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "嗐，这栋楼被当成了战场，又被炸弹炸了一通，那些艺术品没法放在这，楼空着又可惜，不如拿来搞点副业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "正好多索雷斯电视台缺了雷内尔这个热点，开始把鼻子伸到我们社区来，造谣说我们的艺术家们没人会做饭，整天吃仙人掌干过日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "我倒要让他们看看什么才是真正的玻利瓦尔美食！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "text": "那，这个串烤洋葱蘑菇驮兽肉来一份——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "两份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "好嘞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "呼......迪亚兹先生的手艺真是没的说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "说真的，我们四个也在泰拉游历了许多地方，玻利瓦尔的烤肉可还是头一次品尝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "你们之前都去了哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我们一开始落在了萨尔贡的荒漠里，在罗德岛短暂停留，取得了“彩虹小队”身份之后，我们各自又去了一些地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "萨尔贡的雨林，萨米的冰原，哥伦比亚的矿场和城市，乌萨斯针叶林间的村庄......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "尽管如此，我们踏足过的地方也只是这片大地很小的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "唯一的遗憾是列维·克里奇科和他疯狂的实验室一起埋在了萨尔贡的地下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "如果有人犯了思乡病，恐怕只能找一条和来时不一样的路回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "那你们找到了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "（耸肩）还差得远。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "text": "我想你们一定不介意多几个旅伴帮你们一起找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哈哈哈，越多越好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "呃，Lord，那个是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "各位，我来替Lord隆重介绍一下这款“乌萨斯特饮”——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "窗外忽然传来吵闹声。\n吃饱喝足的彩虹小队成员们扭头看去，习惯性地以为克里斯达尔艺术馆外又出了什么麻烦——\n然后，第一个明白了是什么情况的人无奈地耸了耸肩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "text": "我们已经跟老爹说好了，今天轮到我们跳沃尔珀小步舞的用这块广场，你们的古典音乐该关掉了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的贵族",
      "text": "可特克诺说她最近就喜欢听我们三拍子的华尔兹！不信你问她，她就在墙边上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "text": "就是就是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "text": "特克诺，你过来，你说这事到底怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "哼，别用这种事烦我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "有时间为了放什么音乐吵架，不如来看看我的作品！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "text": "你的作品？可你的手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "哎呀，过来就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "text": "呜哦！这......这真是你画的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "哈哈，我苦练了这么长时间，终于抓到用左手用劲的门道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "特克诺，别练了，快进来！你肯定没喝过这种叫乌萨斯特饮的东西，再晚可就没有了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
